DIL SE KABHI NA SHAAM KE MANZER JUDAA HOVEY <br>
SAJJAD KAB GHAMOUN SE YEH PALBHAR JUDA HOVEY<br>
<br>
1. BABA KO YAAD KAR KE WOH ROOTEY HAI HAR GHADI <br>
 SAJJAD SE KABHI BHI NAA SARWAR JUDA HOVEY<br>
<br>
2. RAHOUN MEIB SAATH SAATH THE NAZROUN KE SAMNE <br>
 KAISE BHULAYEIN JISMOUN SE JO SAR JUDA HOVEY<br>
<br>
3. SAJJAD KE LABOO PE SADAYEIN YEHI RAHI <br>
 KARBOBALA MEIN SAB MERE DILBAR JUDA HOVEY<br>
<br>
4. ZANJEER MEIN THEY JAKDE HOVEY DEKH THEY RAHEY <br>
 MAA O SE JO SAFAR MEIN YEH DILBAR JUDA HOVEY<br>
<br>
5. SAJJAD SAR KO PEET KE KHEHTEY THEY BASYAHI <br>
 AKBER JUDA HOVEY ALI ASGHAR JUDA HOVEY<br>
<br>
6. KARBAL KI PYAAS HAR GHADI AHSAAS MEIN RAHI <br>
 BIMAAR KE NA DIL SE BAHATAR JUDA HOVEY